;;;; tests/model/unresolved-terms.sexp
;;;;
;;;; The term references of the whole spec that RESOLVE-TERMS leaves
;;;; unresolved (src/model/resolve-terms.lisp), one row per text:
;;;; (text count reason); the test sorts them.  Reasons:
;;;;   :no-entry    the glossary defines no such term;
;;;;   :compound    a phrase of glossary terms that is not one itself
;;;;                (literal objects: literal, object);
;;;;   :variant     a form of a glossary term no inflection rule derives
;;;;                (execution: execute; macro char: macro character);
;;;;   :not-a-term  a name, argument or number set as a term (with-slots,
;;;;                start1, 9); a source error, \term for \code or \param;
;;;;   :typo        a misspelt glossary term, for a patch (docs/plan/m3.md, 3.19).
;;;; Owner: step 3.19 of docs/plan/m3.md (tests/model/resolve-terms.lisp).

